{"id":47066,"date":"2025-12-06T10:25:03","date_gmt":"2025-12-06T09:25:03","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=47066"},"modified":"2026-08-23T19:17:58","modified_gmt":"2026-08-23T18:17:58","slug":"escalada-cerro-s-miguel-2025","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/escalada-cerro-s-miguel-2025\/","title":{"rendered":"Escalada do Cerro (S. Miguel) 2025"},"content":{"rendered":"<p><!-- IN\u00cdCIO BLOCO REUTILIZ\u00c1VEL: CONTE\u00daDO COMPLETO ESCALADA DO CERRO S. MIGUEL 2025 --><\/p>\n<p><!-- 1. DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O DO EVENTO --><\/p>\n<div  style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 style=\"font-family: Outfit, sans-serif; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 800; color: #FFFFFF; margin-bottom: 12px;\">\n    Sobre a <span  style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Escalada do Cerro de S. Miguel 2025 (Moncarapacho \/ Olh\u00e3o)<\/span><br \/><\/h2>\n<p style=\"font-size: 14.5px; line-height: 1.7; color: #CBD5E1; margin-bottom: 0;\">\n    A tradicional Escalada do Cerro de S. Miguel realiza-se no feriado de ter\u00e7a-feira, 8 de dezembro de 2025 com partida na Casa do Povo de Moncarapacho, em Olh\u00e3o (Faro \/ Algarve). Organizada pela Casa do Povo e AAAlgarve, \u00e9 uma m\u00edtica prova de atletismo em subida cont\u00ednua de 7 km at\u00e9 ao cume do Cerro de S. Miguel. Calcula os teus ritmos de subida na nossa <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/calculadora\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline; font-weight: 600;\" target=\"_blank\">calculadora de pace<\/a> e explora a lista de <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/corridas-faro\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline; font-weight: 600;\" target=\"_blank\">corridas em Faro<\/a> e <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/corridas-algarve\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline; font-weight: 600;\" target=\"_blank\">corridas no Algarve<\/a>.\n  <\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- 2. FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div  style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 24px; padding: 24px 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h3 style=\"font-family: Outfit, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 800; color: #FFFFFF; margin-bottom: 14px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;\">\n    \u26a1 Ficha T\u00e9cnica <span  style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">\/ Snapshot<\/span><br \/><\/h3>\n<ul style=\"list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0; color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 14px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px;\">\n<li style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;\"><strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF; min-width: 100px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 Data:<\/strong><span>8 de dezembro de 2025 (Feriado, 10h00)<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;\"><strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF; min-width: 100px;\">\ud83d\udccd Local:<\/strong><span>Moncarapacho a Cerro de S. Miguel, Olh\u00e3o (Faro)<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;\"><strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF; min-width: 100px;\">\ud83c\udfc3 Dist\u00e2ncias:<\/strong><span>7 km (Subida de Montanha)<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;\"><strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF; min-width: 100px;\">\ud83d\udee3\ufe0f Piso:<\/strong><span>Asfalto de Montanha com Inclinado Exigente (+400m D+)<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- 3. GEOMETRIA DA PROVA --><\/p>\n<div  style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h3 style=\"font-family: Outfit, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 800; color: #FFFFFF; margin-bottom: 12px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;\">\n    \ud83c\udfd4\ufe0f Geometria da <span  style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Prova &amp; Percurso<\/span><br \/><\/h3>\n<p style=\"font-size: 14.5px; line-height: 1.7; color: #CBD5E1; margin-bottom: 0;\">\n    Percurso de 7 km com partida plana em Moncarapacho e rampeamento vertiginoso nos \u00faltimos 3,8 km at\u00e9 ao cimo do Cerro de S. Miguel.\n  <\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- 4. BANNER CALCULADORA --><\/p>\n<style>\n  .pr-calc-event-banner { background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.08) !important; border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25) !important; border-radius: 16px !important; padding: 18px 22px !important; margin: 24px 0 !important; display: flex !important; align-items: center !important; justify-content: space-between !important; flex-wrap: wrap !important; gap: 14px !important; font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif !important; }\n  .pr-calc-event-header { display: flex !important; align-items: center !important; gap: 8px !important; margin-bottom: 4px !important; }\n  .pr-calc-event-title { color: #FFFFFF !important; font-size: 15px !important; font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif !important; font-weight: 700 !important; }\n  .pr-calc-event-desc { color: #94A3B8 !important; font-size: 13px !important; display: block !important; }\n  .pr-calc-event-btn { display: inline-flex !important; align-items: center !important; gap: 8px !important; background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(196, 181, 253, 0.2) 0%, rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.3) 100%) !important; border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.5) !important; color: #C4B5FD !important; font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif !important; font-size: 13px !important; font-weight: 700 !important; padding: 10px 20px !important; border-radius: 20px !important; text-decoration: none !important; }\n<\/style>\n<div >\n<div>\n<div ><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\u23f1\ufe0f<\/span><br \/><span >Vais correr esta prova com um objetivo de tempo?<\/span><\/div>\n<p><span >Calcula a tua estimativa de tempo final na nossa calculadora ou consulta a tabela de paces.<\/span><\/div>\n<p><a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/calculadora\/\" >Calculadora de Pace \u2192<\/a><\/div>\n<p><!-- 5. ALOJAMENTO --><\/p>\n<div  style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h3 style=\"font-family: Outfit, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 800; color: #FFFFFF; margin-bottom: 12px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;\">\n    \ud83c\udfe8 Onde <span  style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Ficar em Moncarapacho \/ Olh\u00e3o (Alojamento)<\/span><br \/><\/h3>\n<ul style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.7; padding-left: 20px; margin-bottom: 0;\">\n<li style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Moncarapacho \/ Olh\u00e3o:<\/strong> Turismos rurais no barrocal e hot\u00e9is no centro de Olh\u00e3o.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- 6. GASTRONOMIA --><\/p>\n<div  style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h3 style=\"font-family: Outfit, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 800; color: #FFFFFF; margin-bottom: 12px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;\">\n    \ud83c\udf0d Sobre o Local &amp; <span  style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Gastronomia<\/span><br \/><\/h3>\n<p style=\"font-size: 14.5px; line-height: 1.7; color: #CBD5E1; margin-bottom: 0;\">\n    Arroz de marisco de Olh\u00e3o, Lit\u00e3o \u00e0 moda de Olh\u00e3o e torta de alfarroba com figo.\n  <\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- 7. FAQS --><\/p>\n<section  style=\"margin-top: 32px; text-align: left;\">\n<h3 style=\"font-family: Outfit, sans-serif; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 900; color: #FFFFFF; margin-bottom: 8px;\">\n    Perguntas <span  style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes<\/span><br \/><\/h3>\n<p style=\"font-size: 14px; color: #94A3B8; margin-bottom: 20px;\">D\u00favidas habituais sobre a Escalada do Cerro de S. Miguel 2025.<\/p>\n<div >\n<details >\n<summary >Onde posso consultar as classifica\u00e7\u00f5es e resultados da prova?<\/summary>\n<div >\n<p>Os resultados oficiais ficam dispon\u00edveis no Crono AAAlgarve e no Portugal Running.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details >\n<summary >Onde posso ver as fotografias do evento?<\/summary>\n<div >\n<p>As fotos s\u00e3o partilhadas na AAAlgarve e Casa do Povo de Moncarapacho.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<\/section>\n<p><!-- FIM BLOCO REUTILIZ\u00c1VEL --><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":47068,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"elementor_header_footer","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[22,497],"event_type_2":[728,149],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[],"class_list":["post-47066","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-moncarapacho-olhao","event_type-trail","event_type-trail-curto","event_type_2-algarve-e-sul","event_type_2-faro"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/12\/Popv84snc4339-1-724x1024.jpg","ams_acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/47066","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalru